msgstr ""
"Informasi sistem anda telah disalin pada papan klip sehingga anda dapat "
"menempelkannya pada forum."

#: usr/lib/linuxmint/mintreport/app.py:526
msgid "System information uploaded"
msgstr "Informasi sistem diunggah"

#: usr/lib/linuxmint/mintreport/app.py:526
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Your system information was uploaded to %s. This link was placed in your "
"clipboard."
msgstr ""
"Sistem informasi Anda diunggah ke %s. Tautan diletakkan dalam papan klip "
"Anda."

#: usr/lib/linuxmint/mintreport/app.py:528
msgid "An error occurred while uploading the system information"
msgstr "Terjadi kesalahan saat mengunggah informasi sistem"

#: usr/lib/linuxmint/mintreport/app.py:528
msgid ""
"Copy and paste the system information manually into a pastebin site like "
"https://pastebin.com."
msgstr ""
"Salin dan tempel informasi sistem secara manual ke dalam situs pastebin "
"seperti https://pastebin.com."

#: usr/lib/linuxmint/mintreport/app.py:624
msgid "Ignore this report"
msgstr "abaikan laporan ini"

#: usr/lib/linuxmint/mintreport/app.py:640
msgid "Are you sure you want to ignore this report?"
msgstr "Apakah anda yakin ingin mengabaikan laporan ini?"

#: usr/lib/linuxmint/mintreport/app.py:641
msgid "The report will be permanently ignored and will no longer be visible."
msgstr "Laporan akan diabaikan secara permanen dan tidak akan terlihat lagi."

#: usr/lib/linuxmint/mintreport/app.py:730
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The debug symbols are missing for %(program)s.\n"
"Please install %(package)s."
msgstr ""
"Simbol untuk debug tidak ditemukan untuk %(program)s.\n"
"Harap instal %(package)s."

#: usr/lib/linuxmint/mintreport/app.py:744
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The package providing %s could not be found.\n"
"If you want to generate a stack trace for this crash report, please "
"reinstall it."
msgstr ""
"Paket yang menyediakan %s tidak dapat ditemukan.\n"
"Jika Anda ingin menghasilkan laporan yang lebih detail terkait kerusakan "
"ini, silahkan instal ulang."

#: usr/lib/linuxmint/mintreport/app.py:772
msgid ""
"The headers or binaries installed on your system do not match the code which "
"was executed during the crash.\n"
"They probably got upgraded since.\n"
"A stack trace is available in 'Local Files' but its content is probably "
"inaccurate."
msgstr ""
"Header atau binari yang diinstal pada sistem Anda tidak cocok dengan kode "
"yang dieksekusi saat crash\n"
"Kemungkinan telah dilakukan peningkatan.\n"
"Detail eror ada di 'File Lokal' tetapi isinya mungkin tidak akurat."

